summary   The run failed before Task 1 started. The SDD controller loaded the
          skill and set up the branch and ledger, and its context hit
          the compaction threshold before it dispatched any subagent.
          After each compaction it re-read the whole 76KB
          subagent-driven-development SKILL.md, which filled the context
